# p_4c7e — The Late Night, Corrected: No Guitar, Blanket Migrates to Coffee Table (fork of p_c9d4)

This is a fork of p_c9d4 that corrects three major errors the evidence has exposed. First, the guitar: five out of five sighted days show guitar_hana on bedroom_floor_b1, and the "guitar at coffee table 22:00" claim has gone against four times with zero for. There is no evidence of any evening guitar session. The guitar simply stays on the bedroom floor all day and night. Second, the blanket: weekday sightings show couch_l1 from 03:00 through 18:00, then coffee_table_l1 at 21:00 (×2) and 22:00 (×1). The blanket does not stay on the couch during TV; it migrates to the coffee table where the residents sit. Third, the snack bowl: it is on counter_k1 at 18:00 (×1) and 19:00 (×3) during dinner, then appears on coffee_table_l1 at 21:00 (×2). The 20:00–23:00 window in the parent is too early on the start; the bowl is still in the kitchen at 20:00.

What changed from the parent: guitar_hana is now permanently at bedroom_floor_b1 (no ON_PERSON, no coffee_table block). blanket_shared moves to coffee_table_l1 from 20:00 onward (not couch_l1). snack_bowl_shared gets a counter_k1 block at 18:00–21:00 before the coffee_table block at 21:00–23:00, and its overnight resting place is sink_k1 (confirmed by 03:00 sightings ×2). The remote block is kept at tv_stand_l1 for weekdays since no evening weekday sighting contradicts it; the weekend coffee_table pattern is handled by a separate document.

What would refute this: guitar_hana sighted at ON_PERSON or coffee_table_l1 at any hour; blanket_shared at couch_l1 at 21:00 or 22:00 on a weekday; snack_bowl_shared at coffee_table_l1 at 19:00 on a weekday.

